{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Vivica sits quietly thinking for a moment. \"I would like to say I understand your position, but I can't. If I saw someone going through what happened to me, I would do everything I could to save them. If it wasn't for the Ravens I wouldn't be here, I would still suffer nightmares and -\" she stops and takes a deep breath trying to calm her nerves \"I guess I'm just disappointed to hear that as your answer, but I'm not sure what I was expecting to hear.\"","created_at":"2021-08-21T09:26:35.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878570772946370560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
